        {
            "_id": "0p1NhIRJKhPkA0yM",
            "img": "systems/sf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
            "name": "Rejuvenation",
            "sort": 1000000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "passive"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "defensive",
                "deathNote": true,
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>When the techno graveknight is destroyed, their armor rebuilds their body over the course of 1d10 days—or more quickly if the armor is worn by a living host (see graveknight's curse). If the body is destroyed before then, the process restarts. The techno graveknight can only be permanently destroyed by obliterating their armor (such as with disintegrate), transporting it to the Forge of Creation, or throwing it into the heart of a volcano, star, black hole, or similarly destructive environment.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [],
                "slug": null,
                "traits": {
                    "value": [
